  - signal processing
abstract: >-
  Code for the EUSIPCO 2025 study of how data sparsity affects machine learning
  for fault detection and fault line identification in power system protection,
  covering individual relay failures, bus-level communication loss, downsampling,
  missing voltage or current channels, and intermittent block dropouts.
repository-code: "https://github.com/julianoelhaf/eusipco2025-sparse-fault-detect"
